WEBVTT

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:19.120
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Hello?

00:00:20.073 --> 00:00:21.355
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Hi, Jennifer?

00:00:21.797 --> 00:00:22.381
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Yes.

00:00:22.905 --> 00:00:26.280
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> This is Rob Walker from London 24Seven.

00:00:26.737 --> 00:00:29.915
I’m phoning to check you got the email I sent you.

00:00:30.419 --> 00:00:32.199
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Er, what was it about?

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.341
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> It was the information about your hotel for next week.

00:00:37.055 --> 00:00:37.893
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Just a second.

00:00:40.247 --> 00:00:41.633
Yes, here it is.

00:00:41.694 --> 00:00:44.486
Hotel Indigo, London Street.

00:00:44.912 --> 00:00:46.045
Where is it exactly?

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:51.031
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> It’s very near Paddington Station.

00:00:51.433 --> 00:00:56.160
You can get the Heathrow Express train from the airport to the station.

00:00:56.202 --> 00:00:58.516
It only takes about 15 minutes.

00:00:59.329 --> 00:00:59.869
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Great.

00:01:00.505 --> 00:01:02.657
Can I walk to the hotel from the station?

00:01:04.945 --> 00:01:06.945
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Yes, it’s very near.

00:01:07.736 --> 00:01:09.655
Can you see it on the map?

00:01:10.161 --> 00:01:13.582
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Er… yes, I have it now.

00:01:13.882 --> 00:01:16.680
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Turn left when you leave the station.

00:01:17.188 --> 00:01:22.518
Then go straight on for a bit and turn right into London Street.

00:01:23.145 --> 00:01:25.491
The hotel’s opposite Norfolk Square.

00:01:26.137 --> 00:01:26.870
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Great.

00:01:28.994 --> 00:01:33.097
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I can come to the hotel in the morning on your first day.

00:01:33.424 --> 00:01:35.730
We can walk to the office together.

00:01:37.271 --> 00:01:38.557
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> OK. See you then.

00:01:39.464 --> 00:01:39.864
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Bye.

00:01:41.017 --> 00:01:41.410
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Bye.